# PDFs stay out by default — the repo is public and a full ATS résumé carries
# more personal data (phone, address) than a portfolio needs to hand out. The
# one in `public/` is the deliberate exception: it is the copy offered from the
# rail, so check what is in it before replacing it. Working drafts at the repo
# root are still ignored.
*.pdf
!public/*.pdf

# local tooling and working notes — kept on disk, not part of the project
.agents/
.claude/
# design-hook cache. It was neither git-ignored nor prettier-ignored, so it
# failed `prettier --check .` locally and was one `git add -A` away from being
# committed to a public repo.
.impeccable/
CLAUDE.md
TASKS.md
skills-lock.json

